{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：04:14 2026-10-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：04:14 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：04:14 2026-10-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"案件交由邊界警區刑事調查隊第三隊跟進。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c76a6b947132e45eb914269f2ff3cf9d/2026-10/179261357224556.jpg\"/><p>周三（21日）下午2時46分，一名姓葉（47歲）男子在打鼓嶺沙嶺道一村屋外，與4名男子發生爭執，期間涉嫌揮舞一把平鑿。</p><p>警方接報到場後，在葉男身上檢獲平鑿。經初步調查，葉男涉嫌藏有攻擊性武器被捕，現正被扣留調查。案件交由邊界警區刑事調查隊第三隊跟進。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T20:21:41.345265+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T20:14:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T20:54:23.148440+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T20:17:40.126330+00:00","content_hash":"fb70e469f535ad3fa8be50474654050fd015055db253ac7ef36c1df2a248689c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}